{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47154","headline":"句 · 可朋","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来多不似客，坐久却垂帘。\n虹收千嶂雨，潮展半江天。\n诗因试客分题僻，棊爲饶人下着低。\n伤心尽日有啼鸟，独步残春空落花。\n唯陪北楚三千客，多话东林十八贤。\n乍当暖景飞仍慢，欲就芳丛舞更高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}